00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:03.750
It worked!

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.170
Yuko?

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:12.250
Momo... powerful weapons are heavy.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.380
You got that right.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:17.250
Sis! You're another step closer to becoming ruler
of the great demon horde!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:14.210
<b>SNAP</b>

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:15.330
<b>SNAP</b>

