<b>SNAP</b>

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:16.330
<b>SNAP</b>

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:20.460
<b>SNAP</b>

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.790
Ugh, my back...

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:26.880
Shamiko. That rod seems to be pretty formidable,
so you need to take good care of it.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.460
Oh, wait a second. I'll write that down...

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:31.130
<b>POOOF!!</b>

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.830
See that, Momo?!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.500
It just transformed into a ballpoint pen that's full of ink!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.540
Yep. That's definitely a pen.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.040
Don't you dare lose it.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:44.250
Can't you manage anything else? Like maybe a rocket
launcher that never runs out of missiles or something?

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.830
I'm sorry. I'm not really sure what that's like...

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.670
Of course. I figured that's what you were going to say.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:50.880
I'll study up on it.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:54.460
<b>Zhanmadao</b>

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:54.460
Try an anti-cavalry sword!
I think that would be the best for you in a fight!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.630
Why are you assuming that I would have
a need to cut down horses?!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.630
<b>Zhanmadao</b>

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.460
Well, let's consider new ideas one by one...

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.920
Momo! Look! I made it a shovel!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.670
I can see that. Shovels certainly are useful...

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:11.290
What's that, Ms. Momo?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.830
An anti-tank rifle.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.920
Personally, I don't think that'll work very well.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:24.250
You know, I think that Momo
used to smile a lot more in the past.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:28.960
It's true. I don't think I've ever seen
Momo smile ear to ear.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.790
Although, I have seen her pout and laugh on occasion.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.130
But I wanna see her smile!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.130
I bet she would look super cute.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.790
And I'm not just saying that out of personal interest,

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:44.210
I also feel like it's a demon's duty
to ensure their vassals are happy!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:46.420
I'm sure of it!

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:49.040
Okay! Let's put a smile on that face.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.790
<b>CLUTCH...</b>

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:53.170
I'm gonna use this newfound demonic ability of mine
to bring the house down with laugher!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.040
Try searching for "weapons that resonate with people."

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:58.830
Weapons that resonate, huh?

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.250
Um, Momo?

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:04.920
<b>BA</b>

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:04.920
<b>WOMP</b>

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:02.960
Check out my demonic impression.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.630
I'm a "forklift"...

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:09.290
Uh, sorry.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:08.580
<b>WOOOSH</b>

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:09.750
<b>WOOOSH</b>

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:14.040
Your voice was so low, I couldn't hear you. What was it?

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:13.290
<b>WOOOSH</b>

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:14.210
<b>WOOOSH</b>

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:17.670
I'LL GET YOU ONE OF THESE DAYS, MAGICAL GIRL!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:19.330
Yuko. You're disturbing the neighbors.

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:21.080
Don't give up, Shamiko!

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:20.710
CURSE YOU! MOMOOOOO!

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:25.290
When it comes to cracking jokes,
confidence and determination mean more than quality.

00:23:56.170 --> 00:24:11.080
<b>PREVIEW</b>

00:23:57.210 --> 00:24:00.130
We found a precious heirloom from my dad, a magic rod!

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:03.000
You're lacking a lot of information
that you really need, Shamiko.

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:04.580
So let's get you set up with the Internet.

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:06.750
I see you finally made an account, Shamiko!

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:07.790
Yes, I did!

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.080
<b>THE DARK WITCH RETURNS! WITH STEAM FROM HELL!</b>

00:24:07.790 --> 00:24:10.630
Shamiko, I wanna go to the hot spring!
